OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Fshowers or longer spells of rain
OL,7,Fspreading in from the southwest. Some
OL,8,Fof the showers could be heavy and
OL,9,Fthere's a chance of thunder in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers will continue
OL,13,Fthrough the evening, these heavy and
OL,14,Fthundery in places. These showers will
OL,15,Fslowly ease overnight but the odd one
OL,16,Fwill linger until dawn.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,19,Fshowers, perhaps heavy in places, then
OL,20,Fbecoming dry through the afternoon.
OL,21,FWarm near the East Coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
